  "key": "IBMCEPH-1234",
  "fields": {
    "summary": "RGW: bucket resharding fails with ENOENT on multisite secondary",
    "description": "When performing dynamic bucket resharding on a multisite secondary zone, the operation fails with:\n\n```\n2024-10-20 14:30:12.345 7f1234567890 0 ERROR: get_bucket_info on bucket=test-bucket returned err=-2\n```\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n1. Configure multisite with two zones\n2. Enable dynamic resharding on secondary\n3. Write enough objects to trigger reshard\n\nExpected: reshard completes successfully\nActual: ENOENT error, bucket becomes inaccessible",
